=== MDV-P4-004
title: Charge capture and invoice lifecycle (draft → issued → paid/failed/refunded), separate from clinical sign-off (P-06)
type: Story
epic: MDV-P4-E01
prd: P4-02
screens: P-06
priority: MUST
roles: Receptionist
labels: billing, invoices
estimate: 3
weeks: 18-19
depends: MDV-P4-002
confidence: 86 | Invoice states, actions and events are designed in detail.
sources: design/Medvya Clinician App (P-06 Billing); docs/02-design/screen-specs.md#billing-p4--medvya-clinician-app
desc:
/billing: invoice list with state chips; detail with lines (service, code, qty, tax, amount), discount with mandatory reason, totals, events timeline. Suggested lines from the encounter (services, procedures, in-house tests) marked "suggested" for the receptionist to confirm — billing never changes clinical records. Patient banner in admin view (no clinical data). Actions per state as designed.
ac:
- Invoice states and allowed actions match docs/03-architecture/state-machines.md#invoice-p4 (server-enforced).
- Discounts require a reason and are audited; issued invoices are immutable (ledger) — corrections via credit note.
- Billing screens never display clinical notes or diagnoses (security test on payloads).
- Issuing assigns the legal number from DOC_SEQUENCE.

=== MDV-P4-005
title: Receipts, tax invoices, credit notes, advance receipts for India GST and UAE VAT in A5 and 80 mm thermal (P-15)
