=== MDV-P4-007
title: India payments with Razorpay (UPI collect/QR, card, refunds) and idempotent webhooks (P-10)
type: Story
epic: MDV-P4-E02
prd: P4-03
screens: P-10
covers: nfr:1, dep:1
priority: MUST
roles: Receptionist, Patient
labels: payments, india
estimate: 3
weeks: 19-20
depends: MDV-P4-004, MDV-P4-032
confidence: 72 | Integration pattern standard; merchant approval timing is an external dependency.
sources: PRD v2 P4-03, NFR 1, dependency 1; design/Medvya Clinician App (Send UPI link, Awaiting provider confirmation)
desc:
Payment adapter for Razorpay: UPI collect request / QR / payment link, card; tokenisation by provider only (no card data stored). "Paid" only after verified provider webhook (pay.pending "Awaiting provider confirmation"); timeouts → failed with retry. Webhooks verified by signature, idempotent by event id.
ac:
- An invoice becomes Paid only after a verified webhook or provider API confirmation (test with forged webhook rejected).
- Replaying the same webhook 10 times changes state once (idempotency test).
- No card number, CVV or UPI PIN is ever stored or logged.
- Payment failures and timeouts show "Payment failed" with retry and record-cash options.

