=== MDV-P4-009
title: Split and partial payments with advance usage; balance moves to dues (P-10)
type: Story
epic: MDV-P4-E02
prd: P4-03
screens: P-10
priority: MUST
roles: Receptionist
labels: payments
estimate: 2
weeks: 21
depends: MDV-P4-007
confidence: 88 | Interactive design with remaining/over-collected rules.
sources: design/Medvya Clinician App (P-10 split payment)
desc:
Collect one invoice with cash + UPI + card + advance in any combination; live remaining amount ("Balance remaining" / "Fully covered" / "Over-collected · reduce an amount"); confirming with a remaining balance moves it to Dues with a due date; log per method (received by, provider confirmed, card approved, advance adjusted).
ac:
- Over-collection cannot be confirmed.
- Each split is a PAYMENT_SPLIT with its own state; the invoice is Paid only when all non-cash splits are confirmed.
- Remaining balance creates a DUE with due date and appears in dues (P-12).
- Advance usage reduces the advance balance atomically.

