=== MDV-P4-012
title: Cash reconciliation and day-end close with denominations, second-person confirmation and shift report (P-07, P-13)
type: Story
epic: MDV-P4-E02
prd: P4-04
screens: P-07, P-13
covers: exit:1
priority: MUST
roles: Receptionist, Practice admin
labels: cash, day-close
estimate: 3
weeks: 22-23
depends: MDV-P4-009, MDV-P4-008
confidence: 86 | Designed with denominations per country, variance rule and summary.
sources: design/Medvya Clinician App (P-13 day-end cash close); design/Medvya Wireframes (P-07)
desc:
CASH_SESSION: opening float, counted denominations (INR/AED sets), expected cash from receipts, summary by method (cash, UPI settled, card batch, refunds, insurer receivable), variance. Any variance requires a note and a second staff member's confirmation ("Attention · cash short ₹200"). Close produces a shift report PDF.
ac:
- Expected cash equals the sum of cash receipts minus cash refunds plus float (test).
- Closing with variance ≠ 0 requires a note and a second, different staff user's confirmation.
- Closed sessions are immutable; corrections create an adjustment entry.
- Pilot clinics close with zero unexplained variance for 10 consecutive days (exit gate 1, tracked in MDV-P4-033).

