desc:
Threads by category with owner and SLA; filters (Open, …). AI drafts a reply (dashed "AI draft") that staff edit/approve before sending; clinical questions are flagged "Attention · clinical question. Routed to Dr. … Staff can acknowledge but only a clinician can give medical advice." Message bodies encrypted at rest.
ac:
- No AI-drafted reply is sent without explicit staff approval.
- Clinical questions are routed to the clinician; non-clinicians cannot send clinical advice (role check on send for flagged threads).
- SLA breach shows on the thread and in notifications.
- Message content never appears in push notifications or logs.

