=== MDV-P4-027
title: Public doctor and clinic profiles with live availability, indexed for search (N-02, design needed)
type: Story
epic: MDV-P4-E05
prd: P4-08
screens: N-02
priority: SHOULD
roles: Public, Patient
labels: public-site, seo, design-needed
estimate: 3
