confidence: 80 | Analytics page designed (KPIs, charts, open loops) with explicit "estimate" caveat.
sources: design/Medvya Enterprise Pages (H-07); docs/02-design/screen-specs.md#enterprise-p7--medvya-enterprise-admin-medvya-enterprise-pages
desc:
KPIs: visits, notes signed same day, documentation time per visit (estimate with method caveat), unreviewed results > 48 h, no-show rate, revenue, follow-up completion; charts (visits per day by doctor/location, open loops); drill-down only to authorised detail. Owner walkthrough session.
ac:
- Documentation time is labelled as an estimate with the method stated; no clinical outcome claims.
- Drill-down respects role permissions (admins see counts; clinicians see their patients).
- Figures reconcile with source data for a sample month.
- Owner dashboard walkthrough delivered to each pilot owner (delivery package 2).

