sources: PRD v2 §08, P4 exit criteria
desc:
Pilot R4 on flags; collect evidence: 10 consecutive days of zero unexplained cash variance; adviser-approved invoice formats; 0 abnormal results unacknowledged > 72 h; ≥ 30 % bookings confirmed by patients via portal/WhatsApp. Release notes; journeys J1 (billing) and J5 (results loop) pass.
ac:
- Evidence for all four exit criteria attached and confirmed.
- Clinical safety reviewer signs the release (results loop and portal release rules).
- R4 release notes list P4-01…P4-10 status and exclusions (insurance claims, teleconsultation).
- Playwright J1 billing step and J5 delayed-result journey pass.
